-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Obsidian community plugins
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

`.obsidian/plugins/` contains 25 third-party Obsidian community plugins,
redistributed unmodified so the vault works immediately on clone. Each
remains the copyright of its own author, under its own licence. Among them:

    Apache-2.0   Dataview, Style Settings, TikZJax
    MIT          Emoji Toolbar, and others

Several bundle further dependencies with their own terms, including React
and Fraction.js.

Obsidian does not install plugins' LICENSE files, so those terms are not
reproduced here. Each plugin's author and source repository are recorded in
`.obsidian/plugins/<plugin>/manifest.json`.

To use this vault without redistributed plugin code, delete
`.obsidian/plugins/` and reinstall from Obsidian's community plugin browser.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Obsidian themes
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

`.obsidian/themes/` contains the third-party themes Apex, Encore, Minimal
and Vanilla AMOLED Color, each under its own licence and copyright.
